{"id":"arina-east-residences","projectId":"f8b877eb3d354bdfa56ef5b1b60924ca","name":"Arina East Residences","fetched":"2026-10-05","facts":{"address":"6C & 6D TANJONG RHU ROAD","postalCode":"NA","district":"D15","area":"East Coast / Marine Parade","segment":"RCR","lat":1.299363,"lon":103.884341,"tenure":"Freehold","developer":"ZACD LV Development Pte. Ltd.","totalUnits":107,"launchDate":"2025-06-07","launchNote":null,"completionDate":"2027-12-31","completionNote":"Q4 2027","siteArea":"4367.60 sqm","description":"Arina East Residence, where luxury living meets unparalleled sophistication. Nestled at the entrance of the up and coming Marina East precinct, this freehold development redefines urban living with its seamless blend of elegance and tranquillity. Set against the stunning backdrop of the spectacular Marina Bay and the Idyllic East Coast, Arina East Residence offers residents a sanctuary within the city, providing the perfect balance between serene waterfront living and the convenience of Singapore’s most iconic destinations.\nArina East Residence is also at the forefront of Singapore’s next wave of urban transformation. The recently announced Kallang Waterfront development and the Marina East precinct are set to bring world-class amenities to the area, while the future Long Island reclamation project will extend a continuous waterfront promenade along Singapore’s coast. These developments promise to elevate the surrounding area into one of the city’s most sought-after residential and recreational hubs, offering a lifestyle of unmatched convenience and luxury.","keyPoints":"Unique Selling Points\n1. Freehold development at city fringe with exclusive 107 units with full condo facilities and 2 landscape decks\n2. Attention up to the minute modern design trends, interior design using ultra large format tiles with digital twinning technology and computerized production and cutting from factory.\n3. 3 minutes walking distance to Katong Park MRT entrance of the Thomson East Coast Line. 2 MRT stations to Gardens by the Bay station & 4 MRT stations to Marina Bay Station.\n4. 10 minutes’ drive to CBD/Marina Bay, 15 minutes’ drive to Changi Airport.\n5. Proximity to premier sporting and lifestyle destinations such as Singapore Sports Hub, The Singapore Indoor Stadium, Gardens by the Bay East, Marina Bay Golf Course and East Coast Park.\n6. Close proximity to abundant of amenities and food.\n7. 3 min walk to Katong Park MRT Station.\n8. Enjoy tranquil and quiet neighbourhood.\n9. Enjoy great investment potential with the upcoming Kallang Alive Master plan, a vibrant sports and lifestyle destination.\n10. Close to prestigious school like Dunman High school and Chung Cheng High (Main)\n11. Premium appliances from Miele and sanitary wares from Kohler.\n12. Kitchen of all unit types except 1 bedroom are naturally ventilated.\n13. Smart Home features and Smart Community Living at your fingertips where ever you go.","facilities":"1st Storey\n1) Guard House\n2) Site Gate\n3) Bin Centre\n4) Genset\n5) Transformer Room\n6) Cable Chamber\n7) Reflection Pool\n2nd Storey\n8) Swimming Pool\n9) Aqua Gym\n10) Jacuzzi\n11) Club House\n12) Kids Pool\n13) Kids Play Area\n19th Storey (SKY TERRACE)\n1) Lounge\n2) Communal Planter\n20th Storey (SKY TERRACE)\n1) Gym\n2) Sky Pool\n3) Pool Deck Lounger\n4) Pavillion with BBQ","nearbyAmenities":"Educational\nWithin 1km*:\n- Dunman High School\n- Etonhouse International Pre-School\nWithin 1-2km*:\n- Canadian International School\n- Chatsworth International School\n- Kong Hwa School\n- Geylang Methodist School (Primary)\n- Tanjong Katong Primary School\n- Chung Cheng High School (Main)\n- Tanjong Katong Girl’s School\n- Tanjong Katong Secondary School\nTransportation\n- Katong Park MRT Station (TEL)\n- Tanjong Katong MRT Station (TEL)\n- Mountbatten MRT Station (CCL)\nFood Centres\n- Jalan Batu Hawker Centre\n- Old Airport Road Food Centre\n- Kallang Estate Food Centre\nEntertainment and Leisure\n- Kallang W